@startuml
title Due consumatori, due tempi

rectangle "VBUS raw" as raw
rectangle "Filtro rapido" as fast
rectangle "Stack USB" as stack
rectangle "Debounce di policy" as debounce
rectangle "Route applicativa" as route

raw --> fast
fast --> stack : attach e unplug
raw --> debounce
debounce --> route : probe e fallback

note right of stack
  Reazione rapida:
  lo stato fisico deve restare vero.
end note

note right of route
  Reazione stabile:
  evita transizioni dovute ai glitch.
end note
@enduml
